{"id":"f1ca995942ded088e380ddac1c30b9488e140099","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238916","title":"我 chovy， GPT 20x 的额度是不是砍了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"murongxdb","excerpt":"OpenAI - @murongxdb - 昨天刚重置，我也没用太多，就用了差不多 10 亿 token ，就剩下 10%了，之前用这么多 token 也没有消耗这么快啊![pasted-image.png · 143]( https:","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>昨天刚重置，我也没用太多，就用了差不多 10 亿 token ，就剩下 10%了，之前用这么多 token 也没有消耗这么快啊</p>\n<p><img alt=\"pasted-image.png · 143\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/6a97beebbd624_1788329707.webp\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/额度\"><li></li> 额度</a><a href=\"/tag/token\"><li></li> token</a><a href=\"/tag/重置\"><li></li> 重置</a></P><p><span>17 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-03 12:28:59 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042623\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 14:24:14 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是不是 ultra+fast 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042645\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2bc8/818e/577971_normal.png?m=1711437107\" alt=\"jinker\" data-uid=\"577971\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jinker\">jinker</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 14:27:47 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也是 20x ，我只开 xhigh+fast 做 plan, high + fast 实现而已。可以明显感觉到重置前用的额度相比现在明显更耐用，可以认为目前最新重置的额度变小了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042675\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 14:32:03 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jinker\">jinker</a> 其实之前就有人说过 OpenAI 的重置活动会降低周限，也就是你耐用的周限没用完，给你重置后降了周限，这种还不如不重置，不过这个也看人，而且我发现如果重置前蹬得太狠，在重置的时候有可能会降低周限，因此还是非必要不要盲目的蹬</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042741\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/626d/dccd/62211_normal.png?m=1757171598\" alt=\"TimePPT\" data-uid=\"62211\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TimePPT\">TimePPT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 14:42:17 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直用 standard 的 high/xhigh ，官方前几天修复 bug 后感觉比之前耐用。<br>体感上 fast 很不划算，max/ultra 还经常过度思考，我现在基本不用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042742\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/78d9/c5c3/469495_normal.png?m=1774244374\" alt=\"murongxdb\" data-uid=\"469495\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 14:42:27 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> #4 唉，也就用了两天，用了就 12 亿左右的 token ，就剩 10%了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042981\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2bc8/818e/577971_normal.png?m=1711437107\" alt=\"jinker\" data-uid=\"577971\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jinker\">jinker</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 15:24:52 +08:00\">23h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/murongxdb\">murongxdb</a> 我也是 10%，现在省着用，xhigh 继续 plan ，实现只开 medium 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043001\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2bc8/818e/577971_normal.png?m=1711437107\" alt=\"jinker\" data-uid=\"577971\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jinker\">jinker</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 15:28:01 +08:00\">23h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> 上一次重置前我还有 85%就重置了，蹬的程度应该没有很大影响，也可能是我还没遇到。不过重置后的确感受到每次都不一样的耐用。而且这次重置前，还有一次重置，那时候我刚好剩下 20%突然 GPT 重置了，然后重置后蛮耐用的，直到这次也就是最新的重置...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043020\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/00a6/64c2/170096_normal.png?m=1774491727\" alt=\"BingoXuan\" data-uid=\"170096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BingoXuan\">BingoXuan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 15:30:59 +08:00\">23h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这两天用了 16 亿 Token ，大部分时候都是 sol high/xhigh plan + luna max sub agent ，体感上确实消耗更快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043441\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da7d/fb92/754606_normal.png?m=1788223999\" alt=\"mathiashu4\" data-uid=\"754606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mathiashu4\">mathiashu4</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 16:42:14 +08:00\">22h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/YvXUvj6.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YvXUvj6.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>这个月开始转 codex ，20x 还有几次重置，现在还剩 45%</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18045071\">\n        \n        <table>\